### 4-qadam: RadiAnt Dasturida Rasmlarni Ko'rish (Shifokor)
* RadiAnt 24/7 ishlab turishi shart emas.
* Kerak bo'lganda RadiAnt'ni oching:
  1. Yuqori paneldagi **"PACS Search"** tugmasini bosing.
  2. Bemor ismini yoki sanani kiriting va qidiring.
  3. Kerakli bemorni tanlab, **"Download"** yoki **"Open"** tugmasini bosing — tekshiruv darhol RadiAnt oynasida ochiladi.
* Yoki Veb-paneldagi (`http://localhost:8000`) bemorlar ro'yxatida **"RadiAnt'da ochish"** tugmasini bosishingiz mumkin.

